[chant:0003 dedication-of-offerings]
[00:00.00]1 {Yo so} bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho
[00:11.40]2 Svākkhāto yena bhagavatā dhammo
[00:18.60]3 Supaṭipanno yassa bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[00:27.02]4 Tam-mayaṁ bhagavantaṁ sadhammaṁ sasaṅghaṁ
[00:33.71]5 Imehi sakkārehi yathārahaṁ āropitehi abhipūjayāma
[00:45.10]6 Sādhu no bhante bhagavā sucira-parinibbutopi
[00:53.47]7 Pacchimā-janatānukampa-mānasā
[00:59.74]8 Ime sakkāre duggata-paṇṇākāra-bhūte paṭiggaṇhātu
[01:10.47]9 Amhākaṁ dīgharattaṁ hitāya sukhāya
[01:17.91]10 Arahaṁ sammāsambuddho bhagavā
[01:24.57]11 Buddhaṁ bhagavantaṁ abhivādemi
[01:31.97]12 {Svākkhāto} bhagavatā dhammo
[01:41.11]13 Dhammaṁ namassāmi
[01:46.43]14 {Supaṭipanno} bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[01:55.41]15 Saṅghaṁ namāmi

[chant:0164 prelude-preliminary-homage]
[02:00.17]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhassa bhagavato pubbabhāga-namakāraṁ karomase

[chant:0004 preliminary-homage]
[02:09.84]1 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa
[02:20.08]1 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa
[02:29.48]1 Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa

[chant:0169 prelude-recollection-of-the-buddha]
[02:39.19]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhānussatinayaṁ karomase

[chant:0010 recollection-of-the-buddha]
[02:45.92]1 Taṁ kho pana bhagavantaṁ evaṁ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato
[02:58.24]2 Itipi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho
[03:05.60]3 Vijjācaraṇa-sampanno sugato lokavidū
[03:12.51]4 Anuttaro purisadamma-sārathi satthā deva-manussānaṁ buddho bhagavā'ti

[chant:0170 prelude-supreme-praise-of-the-buddha]
[03:26.44]1 Handa mayaṁ buddhābhigītiṁ karomase

[chant:0011 supreme-praise-of-the-buddha]
[03:34.25]1 Buddh'vārahanta-varatādiguṇābhiyutto
[03:42.13]2 Suddhābhiñāṇa-karuṇāhi samāgatatto
[03:48.68]3 Bodhesi yo sujanataṁ kamalaṁ va sūro
[03:55.43]4 Vandām'ahaṁ tam-araṇaṁ sirasā jinendaṁ
[04:02.02]5 Buddho yo sabba-pāṇīnaṁ saraṇaṁ khemam-uttamaṁ
[04:10.35]6 Paṭhamānussatiṭṭhānaṁ vandāmi taṁ siren'ahaṁ
[04:18.04]7 Buddhassāh'asmi dāso va buddho me sāmi-kissaro
[04:26.58]8 Buddho dukkhassa ghātā ca vidhātā ca hitassa me
[04:34.50]9 Buddhass'āhaṁ niyyādemi sarīrañ-jīvitañ-cidaṁ
[04:42.25]10 Vandanto'haṁ carissāmi buddhass'eva subodhitaṁ
[04:50.42]11 Natthi me saraṇaṁ aññaṁ buddho me saraṇaṁ varaṁ
[04:58.02]12 Etena sacca-vajjena vaḍḍheyyaṁ satthu-sāsane
[05:06.18]13 Buddhaṁ me vandamānena yaṁ puññaṁ pasutaṁ idha
[05:13.79]14 Sabbepi antarāyā me māhesuṁ tassa tejasā
[05:23.33]16 Kāyena vācāya va cetasā vā
[05:27.17]17 Buddhe kukammaṁ pakataṁ mayā yaṁ
[05:31.01]18 Buddho paṭiggaṇhātu accayantaṁ
[05:36.29]19 Kālantare saṁvarituṁ va buddhe

[chant:0171 prelude-recollection-of-the-dhamma]
[05:41.29]1 Handa mayaṁ dhammānussatinayaṁ karomase

[chant:0012 recollection-of-the-dhamma]
[05:48.52]1 Svākkhāto bhagavatā dhammo
[05:54.81]2 Sandiṭṭhiko akāliko ehipassiko
[06:01.20]3 Opanayiko paccattaṁ veditabbo viññūhī'ti

[chant:0172 prelude-supreme-praise-of-the-dhamma]
[06:08.36]1 Handa mayaṁ dhammābhigītiṁ karomase

[chant:0013 supreme-praise-of-the-dhamma]
[06:15.25]1 Svākkhātat'ādiguṇa-yoga-vasena seyyo
[06:22.97]2 Yo magga-pāka-pariyatti-vimokkha-bhedo
[06:29.60]3 Dhammo kuloka-patanā tada-dhāri-dhārī
[06:35.74]4 Vandām'ahaṁ tama-haraṁ vara-dhammam-etaṁ
[06:42.12]5 Dhammo yo sabba-pāṇīnaṁ saraṇaṁ khemam-uttamaṁ
[06:49.96]6 Dutiyānussatiṭṭhānaṁ vandāmi taṁ siren'ahaṁ
[06:57.81]7 Dhammassāh'asmi dāso va dhammo me sāmi-kissaro
[07:05.90]8 Dhammo dukkhassa ghātā ca vidhātā ca hitassa me
[07:13.29]9 Dhammass'āhaṁ niyyādemi sarīrañ-jīvitañ-cidaṁ
[07:21.37]10 Vandantohaṁ carissāmi dhammass'eva sudhammataṁ
[07:28.80]11 Natthi me saraṇaṁ aññaṁ dhammo me saraṇaṁ varaṁ
[07:36.52]12 Etena sacca-vajjena vaḍḍheyyaṁ satthu-sāsane
[07:44.32]13 Dhammaṁ me vandamānena yaṁ puññaṁ pasutaṁ idha
[07:52.01]14 Sabbepi antarāyā me māhesuṁ tassa tejasā
[08:00.29]16 Kāyena vācāya va cetasā vā
[08:04.20]17 Dhamme kukammaṁ pakataṁ mayā yaṁ
[08:08.11]18 Dhammo paṭiggaṇhātu accayantaṁ
[08:14.04]19 Kālantare saṁvarituṁ va dhamme

[chant:0173 prelude-recollection-of-the-sangha]
[08:19.66]1 Handa mayaṁ saṅghānussatinayaṁ karomase

[chant:0014 recollection-of-the-sangha]
[08:26.76]1 Supaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:34.33]2 Ujupaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:40.99]3 Ñāyapaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:47.98]4 Sāmīcipaṭipanno bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[08:55.25]5 Yadidaṁ cattāri purisayugāni aṭṭha purisapuggalā
[09:03.29]6 Esa bhagavato sāvakasaṅgho
[09:08.86]7 Āhuneyyo pāhuneyyo dakkhiṇeyyo añjali-karaṇīyo
[09:17.88]8 Anuttaraṁ puññakkhettaṁ lokassā'ti

[chant:0174 prelude-supreme-praise-of-the-sangha]
[09:25.67]1 Handa mayaṁ saṅghābhigītiṁ karomase

[chant:0015 supreme-praise-of-the-sangha]
[09:32.31]1 Saddhammajo supaṭipatti-guṇādiyutto
[09:39.06]2 Yo'ṭṭhabbidho ariyapuggala-saṅgha-seṭṭho
[09:45.39]3 Sīlādidhamma-pavarāsaya-kāya-citto
[09:51.65]4 Vandām'ahaṁ tam-ariyāna-gaṇaṁ susuddhaṁ
[09:57.90]5 Saṅgho yo sabba-pāṇīnaṁ saraṇaṁ khemam-uttamaṁ
[10:05.95]6 Tatiyānussatiṭṭhānaṁ vandāmi taṁ siren'ahaṁ
[10:13.31]7 Saṅghass'āhasmi dāso va saṅgho me sāmi-kissaro
[10:21.30]8 Saṅgho dukkhassa ghātā ca vidhātā ca hitassa me
[10:29.22]9 Saṅghass'āhaṁ niyyādemi sarīrañ-jīvitañ-cidaṁ
[10:36.74]10 Vandanto'haṁ carissāmi saṅghassopaṭipannataṁ
[10:44.74]11 Natthi me saraṇaṁ aññaṁ saṅgho me saraṇaṁ varaṁ
[10:51.97]12 Etena sacca-vajjena vaḍḍheyyaṁ satthu-sāsane
[10:59.70]13 Saṅghaṁ me vandamānena yaṁ puññaṁ pasutaṁ idha
[11:07.54]14 Sabbepi antarāyā me māhesuṁ tassa tejasā
[11:15.30]16 Kāyena vācāya va cetasā vā
[11:19.47]17 Saṅghe kukammaṁ pakataṁ mayā yaṁ
[11:23.63]18 Saṅgho paṭiggaṇhātu accayantaṁ
[11:29.42]19 Kālantare saṁvarituṁ va saṅghe
